{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# 📚 Vault Index\n\nEvery folder, root file, agent, specialist, rule, skill, workflow, and scheduled task — with a one-line *what* and *why*. Read [[03-vault-index|the guide]] for the prose enumeration.","x":-100,"y":-200,"width":900,"height":140,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"folders-tier0","type":"text","text":"### 📂 Folders — Tier 0 (active flow)\n\n- **`00 - Chats/`** — AI conversation summaries + `brainstorms/` subfolder. *Durable artifacts only.*\n- **`01 - Daily Notes/`** — One markdown per day. *Capture surface.*\n- **`02 - Projects/`** — Directory-pointer notes. *Notes about projects, not project files.*\n- **`03 - Skills & Rules/`** — Doctrine layer. *How agents act.*\n- **`04 - Templates/`** — Templater skeletons. *Don't type frontmatter by hand.*\n- **`05 - Workflows/`** — Recurring recipes. *When a procedure repeats >2x.*\n- **`06 - Scheduled Tasks/`** — Cron job mirror docs. *Discoverable in Obsidian.*","x":-450,"y":50,"width":420,"height":340,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"folders-tier1","type":"text","text":"### 📂 Folders — Tier 1 (reference)\n\n- **`10 - Topics/`** — Concept graph. *One note per concept.*\n- **`11 - Sources/`** — Web Clipper destination. *Inbox for reading.*\n- **`12 - Software Map/`** — One note per software. *Dependency mesh.*\n- **`13 - Courses/`** — Self-paced trackers. *HTMLs live on disk; vault holds trackers.*\n- **`14 - How To/`** — Tutorial canvases + guides. *Explain the system.*","x":-10,"y":50,"width":420,"height":340,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"folders-tier29","type":"text","text":"### 📂 Folders — Tier 2 / 9 + Dotfolders\n\n**Tier 2 — output / utility**\n- **`20 - Decks/`** — HTML decks from [[presenter]] voice chats.\n- **`21 - Excalidraw/`** — Hand-drawn whiteboards.\n- **`22 - Scripts/`** — Runnable PS + Python scripts (setup, audit, hooks, git-bootstrap). See README.\n\n**Tier 9 — archive**\n- **`99 - Archived/`** — Retired stuff worth keeping for archaeology.\n\n**Dotfolders — infrastructure**\n- **`.claude/`** — Claude Code runtime (agents, skills, settings).\n- **`.claude-plugin/`** — Portability manifest.\n- **`.obsidian/`** — Obsidian config + plugins.\n- **`.git/`** — Repo metadata.","x":430,"y":50,"width":420,"height":340,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"root-files","type":"text","text":"### 📄 Root files\n\n- **`CLAUDE.md`** — Vault-wide operating doctrine (≤200 lines). *Read first.*\n- **`README.md`** — Folder table + doctrine pointers. *First file a visitor reads.*\n- **`ROADMAP.md`** — Phased plan. *Where the project is going.*\n- **`5S_STANDARD.md`** — File standard + drive map. *Disk-side rules.*\n- **`Dashboard.md`** — Daily-driver Dataview page. *Live status.*\n- **`Projects-Index.md`** — Auto-list of projects. *Don't edit by hand.*\n- **`_Command Center.canvas`** — Live dashboard (since 05-17-26).","x":-450,"y":430,"width":620,"height":300,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"special-canvases","type":"text","text":"### 🖼️ Special canvases\n\n- **`_Command Center.canvas`** (root) — Live dashboard composing Dataview views.\n- **`system-overview.canvas`** (How To) — Companion to [[01-system-overview]]. *5-layer architecture.*\n- **`brainstorm-to-project.canvas`** (How To) — Companion to [[02-brainstorm-to-project]]. *7-stage lifecycle.*\n- **`vault-index.canvas`** (How To) — *This canvas.* Category-grouped index.\n- **`obsidian-setup.canvas`** (How To) — Companion to [[04-obsidian-setup]]. Plugins + CSS + theme.","x":195,"y":430,"width":620,"height":300,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"agents-heads","type":"text","text":"### 🤖 Dept heads (5)\n\nLive in `03 - Skills & Rules/Agents/`. Each has memory.\n\n- **[[Orchestrator]]** (Opus) — Front door; routes to dept heads.\n- **[[Builder]]** (Sonnet) — Creates new things.\n- **[[Writer]]** (Sonnet) — Improves text; captures ideas.\n- **[[Archivist]]** (Sonnet) — Compiles, summarizes, finds.\n- **[[Auditor]]** (Opus) — Watches vault health.","x":-450,"y":770,"width":420,"height":320,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"agents-specialists","type":"text","text":"### 🤖 Specialists (11)\n\nLive in `03 - Skills & Rules/Agents/Specialists/`.\n\n- **[[Specialists/course-builder]]** — Builder\n- **[[Specialists/project-scaffolder]]** — Builder\n- **[[Specialists/lesson-writer]]** — Writer\n- **[[Specialists/doc-improver]]** — Writer\n- **[[Specialists/presenter]]** — Writer (voice decks)\n- **[[Specialists/brainstormer]]** — Writer\n- **[[Specialists/topic-compiler]]** — Archivist\n- **[[Specialists/summary-writer]]** — Archivist\n- **[[Specialists/inbox-sweeper]]** — Auditor\n- **[[Specialists/drift-watcher]]** — Auditor (→ scheduled)\n- **[[Specialists/weekly-summarizer]]** — Auditor (→ scheduled)","x":-10,"y":770,"width":420,"height":320,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"agents-runtime","type":"text","text":"### 🤖 Native runtime (`.claude/agents/`)\n\nSession-sandboxed mirrors of the dept heads + two specialists promoted because they run as scheduled tasks. Regenerated from `22 - Scripts/setup-claude-agents.ps1`.\n\n- `orchestrator.md`\n- `builder.md`\n- `writer.md`\n- `archivist.md`\n- `auditor.md`\n- `weekly-summarizer.md`\n- `drift-watcher-quarterly.md`","x":430,"y":770,"width":420,"height":320,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"rules-habits","type":"text","text":"### 📜 Universal habits\n\nRead by every agent.\n\n- **[[Rules/engineering-doctrine]]** — Keystone. Research-first, code over docs.\n- **[[Rules/memory]]** — Per-agent memory protocol.\n- **[[Rules/workflow-spec]]** — Workflow file format.\n- **[[Rules/claude-features]]** — Feature registry + when to suggest.\n- **[[Rules/superseded-infra]]** — Living registry of retired things.","x":-450,"y":1130,"width":420,"height":320,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"rules-conventions","type":"text","text":"### 📜 Vault conventions\n\n- **[[Rules/vault-conventions]]** — Frontmatter, wikilinks, dates, naming.\n- **[[Rules/project-readme]]** — Project README layout.\n- **[[Rules/course-format]]** — Lesson format (HTML on disk, tracker in vault).\n- **[[5S_STANDARD]]** — Disk-side rules + drive map.","x":-10,"y":1130,"width":420,"height":320,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"rules-playbooks","type":"text","text":"### 📜 Playbooks + styles\n\n**Playbooks (mission templates):**\n- **[[Rules/playbook-request]]** — New features, refactors.\n- **[[Rules/playbook-refresh]]** — Persistent bugs after failed fixes.\n- **[[Rules/playbook-retro]]** — Post-session lessons → doctrine.\n\n**Style directives (stackable):**\n- **[[Rules/style-concise]]** — Radical conciseness.\n- **[[Rules/style-no-sycophancy]]** — Always-on. No flattery.\n- **[[Rules/style-announce-role]]** — Always-on. Header + footer + status flip.","x":430,"y":1130,"width":420,"height":320,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"skills","type":"text","text":"### ⚡ Skills (`.claude/skills/`)\n\nSlash commands. Each delegates to canonical doctrine.\n\n- **`/brainstorm`** → [[Specialists/brainstormer]]\n- **`/daily-note-writer`** — Today's daily note.\n- **`/commit-message-writer`** — Commit msg from git diff.\n- **`/course-builder`** → [[Specialists/course-builder]]\n- **`/lesson-content-writer`** → [[Specialists/lesson-writer]]\n- **`/deck-builder`** → [[Specialists/presenter]]\n- **`/project-scaffolder`** → [[Specialists/project-scaffolder]]\n- **`/git-bootstrap`** → [[05 - Workflows/git-bootstrap]]\n- **`/workflow-author`** — New workflow scaffold.\n- **`/specialist-creator`** — New specialist scaffold.\n- **`/drift-fix`** — Apply drift fixes.\n- **`/handoff`** — Next-session handoff doc.\n- **`/audit`** → [[Auditor]] + drift-watcher (judge protocol).\n- **`/sweep-inbox`** → [[Specialists/inbox-sweeper]]\n- **`/compile-topic`** → [[Specialists/topic-compiler]]\n- **`/retro`** → [[Rules/playbook-retro]]\n- **`/forge`** — Cross-session pattern miner → new skills/rules.\n- **`/revive`** — Dormant project resurrection plans.\n\n+ 6 Anthropic-provided: docx, pdf, pptx, xlsx, schedule, skill-creator","x":-450,"y":1490,"width":420,"height":620,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"workflows","type":"text","text":"### 🔁 Workflows (`05 - Workflows/`)\n\nSequenced multi-step recipes invoked by trigger phrase.\n\n- **[[05 - Workflows/audit-pass]]** — Multi-step vault health check.\n- **[[05 - Workflows/git-bootstrap]]** — 9-step init → commit → repo → push.\n- **[[05 - Workflows/new-phase-kickoff]]** — Phase-startup boilerplate.","x":-10,"y":1490,"width":420,"height":420,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"scheduled","type":"text","text":"### ⏰ Scheduled Tasks (`06 - Scheduled Tasks/`)\n\nCowork-managed cron jobs. Vault mirror docs.\n\n- **[[06 - Scheduled Tasks/weekly-summarizer]]** — Sundays 8 AM. Weekly recap + drift sweep + memory consolidation + stuck-status recovery.\n- **[[06 - Scheduled Tasks/drift-watcher-quarterly]]** — 1st of Jan/Apr/Jul/Oct, 9 AM. Full doctrine ↔ disk parity audit.","x":430,"y":1490,"width":420,"height":420,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"link-guide","type":"file","file":"14 - How To/guides/03-vault-index.md","x":-100,"y":1950,"width":900,"height":260},
		{"id":"link-system","type":"file","file":"14 - How To/guides/01-system-overview.md","x":-450,"y":2250,"width":420,"height":180},
